### ============================================================================
### ShareBoard seed data — VS Code REST Client extension format
### (humao.rest-client — the one with the "Send Request" link above each block)
###
### Run top to bottom, ONE AT A TIME, clicking "Send Request" above each block
### in order. Each request that other requests depend on is named with
### "# @name" — later requests pull values from it via {{name.response.body.$.field}}.
### Running out of order, or via a "run all" shortcut, will NOT work correctly —
### this extension resolves those references at click-time, not in a batch.
###
### You still need categories seeded first — there's no POST endpoint for
### those. Run this tiny SQL snippet once before this file:
###
###   USE shareboard;
###   INSERT INTO category (id, name) VALUES
###     (1, 'Blankets'), (2, 'Canned Food'), (3, 'Baby Formula'),
###     (4, 'Coats'), (5, 'School Supplies'), (6, 'Hygiene Kits');
###
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Register accounts (orgs get the verified badge; a couple of individuals too)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name registerShelter
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Riverside Shelter",
  "passwordHash": "Password123",
  "organization": true
}

###

# @name registerMarket
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Corner Market",
  "passwordHash": "Password123",
  "organization": true
}

###

