### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Pair 1: Blankets — will auto-match FULLY the instant the surplus posts
### (posted anonymously, so it should show as "Anonymous Donor" everywhere)
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### NEED: Blankets, 50 units, riverside shelter
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerShelter.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 50,
  "quantityRemaining": 50,
  "urgency": "HIGH",
  "neededBy": "2026-10-20",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

###

### SURPLUS: Blankets, 50 units, corner market, anonymous — matches the need above
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerMarket.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 50,
  "quantityRemaining": 50,
  "availableUntil": "2026-11-01",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": true
}

###


### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Pair 2: Baby Formula — surplus only partially covers the need (20 of 30),
### leaving the need PARTIALLY MATCHED with 10 still open
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### NEED: Baby Formula, 30 units, hope nursery
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerNursery.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 3,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 30,
  "quantityRemaining": 30,
  "urgency": "MEDIUM",
  "neededBy": "2026-10-25",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

###

### SURPLUS: Baby Formula, 20 units, downtown pharmacy — partially fills the need above
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerPharmacy.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 3,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 20,
  "quantityRemaining": 20,
  "availableUntil": "2026-10-30",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

