### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Pair 3: Baby Formula — deliberately incompatible dates, so the deadline-
### crossing check correctly REJECTS this match. Good one to point at live.
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### NEED: Baby Formula, 15 units, needed by Nov 10 — far out deadline
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerNursery.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 3,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 15,
  "quantityRemaining": 15,
  "urgency": "LOW",
  "neededBy": "2026-11-10",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

###

### SURPLUS: Baby Formula, 10 units, expires Oct 5 — BEFORE the need's deadline, won't match
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerPharmacy.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 3,
  "type": "SURPLUS",
  "quantity": 10,
  "quantityRemaining": 10,
  "availableUntil": "2026-10-05",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

###


