### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Withdrawn example — post it, then withdraw it
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name listingToWithdraw
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerShelter.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 5,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 25,
  "quantityRemaining": 25,
  "urgency": "LOW",
  "neededBy": "2026-10-15",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

###

### Withdraw it (requesterId must match the owner — riverside_shelter)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/listings/{{listingToWithdraw.response.body.$.listingId}}?requesterId={{registerShelter.response.body.$.userId}}

###


