### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEMO PAIR — deliberately ONE SIDE ONLY. Send the NEED now (part of seeding).
### During your actual live demo, send the SURPLUS request below in front of
### the audience to trigger a real, fresh, on-camera match.
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### NEED: Canned Food, 200 units, eastside_foodbank — send this now
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{registerFoodbank.response.body.$.userId}},
  "categoryId": 2,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 200,
  "quantityRemaining": 200,
  "urgency": "MEDIUM",
  "neededBy": "2026-11-05",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

